{"4692380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Invariant", "steam_appid": 4692380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a catastrophic incident cuts an isolated Antarctic research facility off from the outside world, an increasingly desperate fight for survival begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As systems fail, communications break down, and hostile creatures roam the facility, pieces of a larger mystery begin to emerge from the chaos left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast underground complex, navigate restricted sectors, solve environmental puzzles, search for supplies, and uncover hidden areas as you progress deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining atmospheric horror with intense first-person combat and logical puzzles, Invariant blends exploration, tense firefights, and resource management into a constant struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4692380/extras/d726fe530819e7a491647384c85ba805.poster.avif?t=1784380822\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4692380/extras/d726fe530819e7a491647384c85ba805.webm?t=1784380822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4692380/extras/d726fe530819e7a491647384c85ba805.mp4?t=1784380822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4692380/extras/4042f0a690675dd3835d96076faf56d0.poster.avif?t=1784380822\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4692380/extras/40